      "name": "Cura",
      "guidance": "To preserve both Cure cards for normal reload, stock a non-Cure card first, then Cure + Cure. A third Cure instead makes Curaga. Cure + Cure + an Item also works; putting a card between the Cures is not established by these examples.",
